@startuml
title EcoTrack WebApp - Frontend Bounded Contexts
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

class "IAM" as FrontendIAM <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Organization Management" as FrontendOrgMgmt <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Emissions Management" as FrontendEmissions <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Carbon Footprint Calculation" as FrontendFootprint <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Goals and Reduction Plans" as FrontendGoals <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Analytics and Reports" as FrontendAnalytics <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Data Integration" as FrontendDataIntegration <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Shared Kernel" as FrontendSharedKernel <<Bounded Context>> {}

FrontendIAM ..> FrontendSharedKernel : session / layout
FrontendOrgMgmt ..> FrontendIAM : user scope
FrontendOrgMgmt ..> FrontendSharedKernel : layout and state
FrontendEmissions ..> FrontendOrgMgmt : facility scope
FrontendEmissions ..> FrontendSharedKernel : layout and state
FrontendFootprint ..> FrontendEmissions : activity data
FrontendFootprint ..> FrontendSharedKernel : layout and state
FrontendGoals ..> FrontendFootprint : footprint results
FrontendGoals ..> FrontendSharedKernel : layout and state
FrontendDataIntegration ..> FrontendEmissions : imported data
FrontendDataIntegration ..> FrontendIAM : role check
FrontendDataIntegration ..> FrontendSharedKernel : layout and state
FrontendAnalytics ..> FrontendOrgMgmt : organization metrics
FrontendAnalytics ..> FrontendEmissions : emissions metrics
FrontendAnalytics ..> FrontendFootprint : footprint metrics
FrontendAnalytics ..> FrontendGoals : goals metrics
FrontendAnalytics ..> FrontendSharedKernel : charts and cards

@enduml
